  "description": "DiffusionSat is a generative foundation model for satellite imagery, based on latent diffusion models, capable of high-resolution image generation, super-resolution, temporal prediction, and inpainting, conditioned on text and numerical metadata.",
  "sci:doi": "10.48550/arXiv.2312.03606",
